The Chinese did not surrender as we had expected - they have a transport hidden away somewhere on Ganymede, and they are all heading for it. You must stop them from reaching the transport, and destroy the transport itself. If they reach that transport, word will get back to China, and they will send reinforcements to deal with us.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Prevent Chinese units from reaching the transport.
- Escape to minimum safe distance (800m) away from the transport.